Thus begins the tale for you:
Let the pile, a whole number, become two.
As long as the pile is less than 100, do:
Let the pile now be the product of the pile and two.
Proclaim the text of the pile.
So be it.
Proclaim "Rest a while".
Proclaim the text of calling square with ten.
Speak "Amen".

To square, taking slumber as whole number, giving whole number:
Give back the product of the slumber and the slumber.
